Changed the "Show partial results" field from a checkbox to a choice: "Only when the poll is closed", "After voting" or "Always, even before voting". `@poll` answers `show_results` as `never`, `after_vote` or `always` instead of a boolean, and with `always` it gives everyone the results while the poll is open. Run the upgrade step to profile version 3001: it converts every poll, checked to "After voting" and unchecked to "Only when the poll is closed". @ericof
